Token in URL — Mini Checklist
Token present?
?token= / ?session= → if no, ignore
Does it give access?
Opens account / resets password → important
Else → ignore
Reusable?
Works in another browser/incognito → 🔴 bad
Expires?
Long-lived → worse
One-time → less impact
Final call:
Access + reusable → High
Limited/temporary → Medium/Low
